# JS RUNTIME — Bun first (standards/3-practice/LANGUAGE-POLICY.adoc sections 1.3-1.4)
# 1. Bun    tier 1: package.json + bun.lock, run with bun / bunx
# 2. Deno   tier 2: permitted; runs the same package.json scripts (deno task)
# 3. pnpm   tier 3
# 4. npm    last resort; permitted, never preferred; keeps no lock
# One package.json carries every runtime's lock (bun.lock, deno.lock,
# pnpm-lock.yaml); `js-runtimes regen` writes all three (owner ruling
# 2026-10-14). TypeScript and ReScript are banned; they migrate to
# AffineScript. Use plain JavaScript where JS is needed.

# BANNED LANGUAGES
# Go -> Rust
# Python -> Julia or Rust

